  "priorExpiration": "2008-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4502.01 Use of Trade Names. Carriers governed by these rules shall not conduct business under any trade name until a copy of the certificate of registration issued by the secretary of state pursuant to the provisions of RSA 349 has been filed with the bureau.\n\nSource. #5853, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7239, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9378, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12357, eff 8-2-17",
